{"unit_id":"tag:021S:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是包含<MATH_0003>的大 fppf 景（big fppf site）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>大 fppf 景（big fppf site），它属于<MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，记为<MATH_0005>，是景（site）<MATH_0006>，在《景（Sites）》第<REF_0001>节中引入。\n<STRUCT_0003> <TEXTITOPEN_0002>大仿射 fppf 景（big affine fppf site），它属于<MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0002>，记为<MATH_0008>，是<MATH_0009>的满子范畴（full subcategory），其对象（objects）为仿射的（affine）<MATH_0010>。<MATH_0011>的覆盖（covering）是任意覆盖（covering）<MATH_0012>，它覆盖<MATH_0013>，且是标准 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"big fppf site","target_term":"大 fppf 景"},{"source_term":"big fppf site","target_term":"大 fppf 景"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"big affine fppf site","target_term":"大仿射 fppf 景"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big fppf site","target_term":"大 fppf 景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Sites","target_term":"景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"big affine fppf site","target_term":"大仿射 fppf 景","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"满子范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
