{"unit_id":"tag:0DBC:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节定义 ph 拓扑（topology）。这是由 Zariski 覆盖（coverings）和固有（proper）满射（surjective）态射（morphisms）生成的拓扑（topology），见引理<REF_0001>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们的记号和术语借自 Goodwillie 和 Lichtenbaum 的论文<REF_0002>。这些作者证明，若限制到诺特（Noetherian）概形（schemes）的子范畴（subcategory），则 ph 拓扑（topology）与 Voevodsky 最初定义的“h 拓扑（topology）”相同：后者是由 Zariski 开覆盖（coverings）和普遍次浸没的（universally submersive）有限型（finite type）态射（morphisms）生成的拓扑（topology）。他们还证明，这两个拓扑（topologies）在非诺特（Noetherian）概形（schemes）上不相同，见<REF_0003>。我们将在《平坦性（Flatness）再论》第<REF_0004>节中回到 h 拓扑（topology）（我们的版本）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n在定义我们拓扑（topology）中的覆盖（coverings）之前，还需要做一些工作。\n\n","allowed_english":["ph","h","Zariski","Goodwillie","Lichtenbaum","Voevodsky"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸没的"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Noetherian","target_term":"诺特","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"subcategory","target_term":"子范畴","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"universally submersive","target_term":"普遍次浸没的","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBD:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个仿射概形（affine scheme）。<TEXTITOPEN_0001>标准 ph 覆盖（standard ph covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>是族（family）<MATH_0002>，从固有（proper）满射（surjective）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>和仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0004>出发，令<MATH_0005>构造而得。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"standard ph covering","target_term":"标准 ph 覆盖"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"standard ph covering","target_term":"标准 ph 覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0DBC:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由 Chow 引理立即可知，标准 ph 覆盖（covering）可以由标准 ph 覆盖（covering）加细，后者对应于满射（surjective）的射影态射（projective morphism）。\n\n","allowed_english":["Chow","ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"projective morphism","target_term":"射影态射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"projective morphism","target_term":"射影态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
