{"unit_id":"tag:0DBE:proof","translation":"设<MATH_0001>固有（proper）且满射（surjective），并给定仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>，如定义<REF_0001>中所述。则<MATH_0003>固有（proper）且满射（surjective）（《态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>）。此外，<MATH_0004>是仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）。证明完毕。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
