{"unit_id":"tag:0ET9:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是态射族（family of morphisms），使得<MATH_0003>局部有限型（locally of finite type），对所有<MATH_0004>均成立。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005>是 ph 覆盖（covering）；\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在 ph 覆盖（covering），加细（refines）<MATH_0006>；且\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0007>是 ph 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"family of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"locally of finite type","target_term":"局部有限型","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0ET9:proof","translation":"(1) 与 (2) 的等价（equivalence）立即由定义<REF_0001>及加细（refinement）的加细（refinement）仍是加细（refinement）这一事实得出。由于 (1) 与 (2) 等价（equivalence），且<MATH_0001>加细（refines）<MATH_0002>，可知 (1) 推出 (3)。最后，假设 (3) 成立。设<MATH_0003>是仿射开集（affine open），并设<MATH_0004>是标准 ph 覆盖（covering），加细（refines）<MATH_0005>。这意味着，对每个<MATH_0006>，有态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，它在<MATH_0008>上。由于<MATH_0009>拟紧（quasi-compact），得到不交并（disjoint union）分解<MATH_0010>，其成员为既开又闭的子概形（closed subschemes），几乎全部为空（empty），使得<MATH_0011>将<MATH_0012>映入（maps）<MATH_0013>。于是<MATH_0014>是标准 ph 覆盖（covering）（小（small）细节略去），加细（refining）<MATH_0015>。因此 (1) 成立。\n","allowed_english":["ph"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"disjoint union","target_term":"不交并"},{"source_term":"closed subschemes","target_term":"既开又闭的子概形"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"small","target_term":"小"},{"source_term":"refining","target_term":"加细"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"equivalence","target_term":"等价","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"disjo